  "bio": "Immerse yourself in the striking artistry of KUSH Ink, a premier tattoo studio nestled in the heart of Deggendorf, Germany. Specializing in bold tribal, avant-garde trashpolka, and meticulous fineline designs, KUSH Ink offers an unforgettable ink experience in a creatively charged ambience. Follow us on Facebook to become part of our edgy, artistic community and to catch a glimpse of our latest mesmerizing creations.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Deggendorf, Bavaria, Germany"
